# ── PRIVATE: rule-production data moat — NEVER commit to this PUBLIC repo ──
# The labeled corpora + attack-embedding reference set are the durable moat
# (some NC-licensed, e.g. Alpaca). The benign gate is fail-closed without them,
# so the public CI runs the small PINT/skill benchmark; the full corpora live in
# the private engine. Methodology (CORPUS.md) + benchmark RESULT json may stay public.
